tected with a 50 mm armor and mounted with a 76.2 mm gun in a T-34 Medium Tank turret, a 37 mm anti-aircraft gun and machine gun ports. The locomotive weighted 362.8 metric tons, plus the optional flat cars for transport, and had a crew of over 100 men. Around 21 BP-43 armored trains were created during WWII.","LocalizedString":"The BP-43 was an armored transport train that was used by the Red Army during WWII. It was developed in 1943 and designed to withstand both Axis air and ground attacks while carrying huge amounts of supplies to the battlefield. The BP-43 had six separate armored cars, each protected with a 50 mm armor and mounted with a 76.2 mm gun in a T-34 Medium Tank turret, a 37 mm anti-aircraft gun and machine gun ports. The locomotive weighted 362.8 metric tons, plus the optional flat cars for transport, and had a crew of over 100 men. Around 21 BP-43 armored trains were created during WWII."},"operationCost":5,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Basic","isInPermanentPool":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnEndOfTurn"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Guard","EHelpBubbleTypes::HeavyArmor1","EHelpBubbleTypes::Trigger"],"heavyArmor":1,"hasGuard":true,"spawnCardName":"card_unit_light_infantry","soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_depl_Train_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Train/AU_depl_Train_Cue.0"},"soundMoveToFrontline":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_depl_Train_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Train/AU_depl_Train_Cue.0"},"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_Exp_Armor_Large_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Card_Blowups/AU_Exp_Armor_Large_Cue.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Soviet/t_armored_train.t_armored_train","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Anthony Cowland","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/BP-43_ARMORED_TRAIN.BP-43_ARMORED_TRAIN","SubPathString":""},"h